EMAIL TEMPLATE SHORTCODES GUIDE
================================

This document lists all available shortcodes that can be used in email templates.
Use shortcodes in the format: {{shortcode_name}}


================================================================================
APPOINTMENT EMAILS
================================================================================
Templates: appointment_confirmation, appointment_reminder, appointment_cancellation,
          appointment_reschedule, appointment_completion

PATIENT INFORMATION
-------------------
{{patient_name}}          - Patient's full name
{{patient_email}}         - Patient's email address

DOCTOR INFORMATION
------------------
{{doctor_name}}           - Doctor's name
{{doctor_specialization}} - Doctor's specialization/specialty
{{doctor_phone}}          - Doctor's phone number
{{doctor_email}}          - Doctor's email address

APPOINTMENT DETAILS
-------------------
{{appointment_date}}      - Appointment date (e.g., December 12, 2025)
{{appointment_time}}      - Appointment time (e.g., 9:30 AM)
{{appointment_type}}      - Type of appointment (e.g., Consultation)
{{notes}}                 - Appointment notes

DEPARTMENT/CLINIC INFORMATION
-----------------------------
{{department}}            - Department/clinic name
{{department_phone}}      - Department/clinic phone number
{{department_email}}      - Department/clinic email address

HOSPITAL INFORMATION
--------------------
{{hospital_name}}         - Hospital/practice name
{{hospital_address}}      - Hospital address
{{hospital_phone}}        - Hospital main phone number

ONLINE CONSULTATION
-------------------
{{is_online}}             - Whether this is an online consultation
{{meeting_link}}          - Video meeting link
{{meeting_platform}}      - Platform name (Zoom, Google Meet, etc.)
{{join_meeting_url}}      - URL to join the meeting

ACTION LINKS
------------
{{reschedule_url}}        - Link for patient to reschedule
{{cancel_url}}            - Link for patient to cancel

REMINDER-SPECIFIC
-----------------
{{days_before}}           - Number of days before appointment (for reminders)


================================================================================
APPOINTMENT RESCHEDULE EMAILS
================================================================================

{{old_date}}              - Previous appointment date
{{old_time}}              - Previous appointment time
{{new_date}}              - New appointment date
{{new_time}}              - New appointment time
{{reschedule_reason}}     - Reason for rescheduling


================================================================================
BILLING/INVOICE EMAILS
================================================================================
Templates: billing_notification, payment_reminder

PATIENT INFORMATION
-------------------
{{patient_name}}          - Patient's full name

BILLING DETAILS
---------------
{{bill_number}}           - Bill number
{{invoice_number}}        - Invoice number
{{billing_date}}          - Date bill was created
{{due_date}}              - Payment due date
{{total_amount}}          - Total amount due
{{balance}}               - Outstanding balance
{{amount_due}}            - Amount currently due
{{description}}           - Description of services
{{type}}                  - Billing type (consultation, procedure, etc.)
{{service_description}}   - Detailed service description

PROVIDER INFORMATION
--------------------
{{doctor_name}}           - Doctor's name
{{department_name}}       - Department name

HOSPITAL/CONTACT
----------------
{{hospital_name}}         - Hospital name
{{hospital_address}}      - Hospital address
{{hospital_phone}}        - Hospital phone
{{billing_phone}}         - Billing department phone

ACTION LINKS
------------
{{payment_url}}           - Link to pay online


