LAB RESULTS/TEST RESULTS EMAILS
================================================================================
Template: test_results_ready

{{patient_name}}          - Patient's full name
{{test_name}}             - Name of the test
{{test_type}}             - Type of test
{{test_date}}             - Date test was performed
{{result_date}}           - Date results became available
{{doctor_name}}           - Ordering doctor's name
{{hospital_name}}         - Hospital name
{{patient_portal_url}}    - Link to view results online
{{contact_phone}}         - Contact phone number


