================================================================================
STAFF NOTIFICATION EMAILS
================================================================================
Template: staff_new_patient_registration

{{staff_name}}            - Staff member's name
{{patient_name}}          - Patient's full name
{{patient_id}}            - Patient ID
{{registration_date}}     - Registration date and time
{{patient_phone}}         - Patient's phone number
{{patient_email}}         - Patient's email address
{{hospital_name}}         - Hospital name
{{patient_url}}           - Link to view patient profile


================================================================================
DOCTOR NOTIFICATION EMAILS
================================================================================
Template: doctor_new_appointment

{{doctor_name}}           - Doctor's name
{{patient_name}}          - Patient's full name
{{patient_phone}}         - Patient's phone number
{{appointment_date}}      - Appointment date
{{appointment_time}}      - Appointment time
{{appointment_type}}      - Type of appointment
{{notes}}                 - Appointment notes
{{hospital_name}}         - Hospital name
{{appointment_url}}       - Link to view appointment
{{is_online}}             - Whether online consultation
{{meeting_link}}          - Meeting link (if online)
{{meeting_platform}}      - Meeting platform name


================================================================================
DOCTOR SCHEDULE/CONTACT UPDATE EMAILS
================================================================================
Templates: doctor_room_change, doctor_contact_update, doctor_department_change,
          doctor_schedule_update

{{patient_name}}          - Patient's name
{{doctor_name}}           - Doctor's name
{{old_room}}              - Previous room (room change)
{{new_room}}              - New room (room change)
{{new_phone}}             - New phone number (contact update)
{{new_department}}        - New department (department change)
{{hospital_name}}         - Hospital name
{{contact_phone}}         - Contact phone number
{{notification_date}}     - Date and time of notification


================================================================================
EXAMPLE USAGE
================================================================================

Example appointment confirmation email body:

Dear {{patient_name}},

Your appointment has been confirmed with the following details:

Doctor: {{doctor_name}}
Specialization: {{doctor_specialization}}
Date: {{appointment_date}}
Time: {{appointment_time}}
Department: {{department}}

Location: {{hospital_address}}

If you need to contact the clinic, please call:
- Clinic: {{department_phone}}
- Hospital: {{hospital_phone}}

{{notes}}

If you need to reschedule or cancel, please click the links below:
- Reschedule: {{reschedule_url}}
- Cancel: {{cancel_url}}

Thank you for choosing {{hospital_name}}.

Best regards,
{{doctor_name}}


================================================================================
NOTES
================================================================================

1. All shortcodes must be enclosed in double curly braces: {{shortcode}}

2. Shortcodes are case-sensitive. Use exactly as shown.

3. If a shortcode value is not available, it will be replaced with an empty
   string or a default value.

4. Not all shortcodes are available in all email templates. Use only the
   shortcodes listed under each template category.

5. To edit email templates, go to:
   Admin Dashboard > Communication > Email Templates
   or
   Admin Dashboard > Email Templates

6. You can preview how shortcodes will be replaced before sending.


